      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/c57346/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-06T18:01:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Couldn't find an answer to this in an existing thread:</p><p>Under normal rules, a hero with multiple power uses in a single turn must select distinct powers to activate. &nbsp;How do these rules apply to the Argent Adept?</p><p>If I have Drake's Pipes (activate perform text on two melody cards) can I activate the same melody card twice? &nbsp;What if I have two copies of the same melody card in play (they are not limited)?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:57.429Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
