    {
      "id": 48418,
      "name": "Ameena",
      "username": "Ameena",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-06T18:16:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This came up recently (in a discussion in which I discovered that songs can be sung multiple times in the same turn, something I'd totally missed up till that point), and I think the conclusion was that because it specifies two <span class=\"bbcode-i\">different</span> Melody cards, they must indeed be two different physical cards. However, if you happen to have two copies of the same card out, you can sing both of them because they're two different cards - they just happen to have the same name.</p>\n<p>I'm <span class=\"bbcode-i\">pretty</span> sure that's how it is, anyway ;).</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:21:51.633Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 6859,
      "topic_slug": "argent-adept-power-reuse",
      "display_username": "Ameena",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
