      "id": 48419,
      "name": "soul31",
      "username": "soul31",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/9e8a1a/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-06T18:16:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Perform and acompany aren`t \"powers\". Drake pipes said - activate two DIFFERENT melody cards. So you cannot activate the same card with it, of course if you have two copies of the same card you can activate them both. About other music cards - you can activate them how many times you can - but remember you can use any power only once so you can use each instrument only once. That`s because using an instument is a power.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:21:51.706Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
